{"term":{"label":"信","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i","title":"盡心上","description":"孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"使","id":"使"},{"form":"信","id":"信"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"天","id":"天"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"小","id":"小"},{"form":"恥","id":"恥"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"臣","id":"臣"},{"form":"莫","id":"莫"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"見","id":"見"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.2992829841302609,"source":"使","target":"子"},{"weight":0.723918839226699,"source":"使","target":"王"},{"weight":1.7817091333745536,"source":"人","target":"恥"},{"weight":1.1531004739521795,"source":"人","target":"大"},{"weight":1.1531004739521795,"source":"人","target":"事"},{"weight":1.1531004739521795,"source":"人","target":"君"},{"weight":1.6639260977181702,"source":"人","target":"臣"},{"weight":0.9707789171582248,"source":"人","target":"信"},{"weight":0.4599532933922342,"source":"人","target":"莫"},{"weight":0.5653138090500605,"source":"人","target":"子"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"信","target":"子"},{"weight":1.8870696490323797,"source":"信","target":"大"},{"weight":3.4965075614664802,"source":"信","target":"小"},{"weight":2.0693912058263346,"source":"莫","target":"大"},{"weight":0.6343066805370119,"source":"莫","target":"下"},{"weight":2.0693912058263346,"source":"莫","target":"君"},{"weight":2.580216829592325,"source":"莫","target":"臣"},{"weight":1.9986221349381272,"source":"下","target":"天"},{"weight":1.1451323043030026,"source":"下","target":"行"},{"weight":0.16430305129127634,"source":"下","target":"王"},{"weight":1.550597412411167,"source":"下","target":"小"},{"weight":0.6343066805370119,"source":"下","target":"君"},{"weight":1.1451323043030026,"sou